#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Availability Heuristic 🧠]

#only("1-")[
- Tendency to overestimate likelihood based on memory 📖
]

#only("1")[
#voiceover("The availability heuristic is the tendency to overestimate the likelihood of events based on their availability in memory.")
]

#only("2-")[
- Example: Overestimating plane crash risk after seeing news 📰🛩️
]

#only("2")[
#voiceover("For example, after seeing news about a plane crash, people might overestimate the risk of plane crashes, because the event is fresh in their memory.")
]

#only("3-")[
- Leads to biased decisions 📉
]

#only("3")[
#voiceover("This can lead to biased decisions in various domains, including financial decision-making.")
]

]

#slide()[
